    "text": "In series <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>∝</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math><br /><br />When S<sub>1</sub> is closed and S<sub>2</sub> is open<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />When S<sub>1</sub> is open and S<sub>2</sub> is closed<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />When S<sub>1</sub> and S<sub>2</sub> both are closed<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
